<div class="pd-taginput-documentation">

	<section id="overview">
		<h2 class="doc-section">Overview</h2>
		<p>
			<code>PDTagInput</code> is an input component for entering multiple short text values (tags).
			Tags are rendered as removable chips, with optional autocomplete suggestions, free-text entry,
			validation limits and full keyboard support. It is a plain value editor - bind a
			<code>List&lt;string&gt;</code> with <code>@@bind-Values</code> and it has no other dependencies,
			so it drops into forms, wizards and dialogs alike.
		</p>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Two-way binding</strong> — <code>@@bind-Values</code> with a <code>List&lt;string&gt;</code></li>
			<li><strong>Suggestions</strong> — optional autocomplete dropdown, excluding already-added tags</li>
			<li><strong>Validation</strong> — max length, max count, duplicates, suggestions-only mode; rejections raise <code>TagRejected</code></li>
			<li><strong>Keyboard</strong> — Enter/comma to commit, Backspace to remove, arrows to navigate suggestions, Escape to dismiss</li>
			<li><strong>Paste-friendly</strong> — pasted comma-separated text is split into tags</li>
			<li><strong>Theming</strong> — full CSS variable support via <code>--pd-taginput-*</code>, light/dark aware out of the box</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section id="quick-start">
		<h2 class="doc-section">Quick Start</h2>

		<DocExample Title="Basic Tag Input"
					AnchorId="basic-taginput"
					Code="@_example1Code"
					Language="razor"
					DemoStyle="min-height: 100px;">
			<DemoContent>
				<PDTagInput @bind-Values="_quickStartTags"
							Suggestions="@(new[] { "Production", "Development", "Test" })" />
			</DemoContent>
			<Description>
				<p>
					Bind a <code>List&lt;string&gt;</code> with <code>@@bind-Values</code>. A new list instance
					is supplied on every change, so plain property setters and change detection both work.
				</p>
			</Description>
		</DocExample>
	</section>

	<section id="parameters">
		<h2 class="doc-section">Parameters</h2>
		<table class="table table-sm doc-props-table">
			<thead>
				<tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr>
			</thead>
			<tbody>
				<tr><td><code>Values</code></td><td><code>List&lt;string&gt;</code></td><td>empty</td><td>The current tags; supports two-way binding via <code>@@bind-Values</code></td></tr>
				<tr><td><code>Suggestions</code></td><td><code>IEnumerable&lt;string&gt;?</code></td><td>null</td><td>Autocomplete suggestions; already-added tags are not offered again</td></tr>
				<tr><td><code>AllowFreeText</code></td><td><code>bool</code></td><td>true</td><td>Permit tags outside the suggestions list</td></tr>
				<tr><td><code>AddOnBlur</code></td><td><code>bool</code></td><td>true</td><td>Commit pending typed text as a tag when the input loses focus (free text only)</td></tr>
				<tr><td><code>CaseSensitive</code></td><td><code>bool</code></td><td>false</td><td>Case sensitivity for duplicate detection and suggestion matching</td></tr>
				<tr><td><code>MaxTagLength</code></td><td><code>int</code></td><td>0</td><td>Maximum length of a single tag; zero means unlimited</td></tr>
				<tr><td><code>MaxTags</code></td><td><code>int</code></td><td>0</td><td>Maximum number of tags; zero means unlimited</td></tr>
				<tr><td><code>IsEnabled</code></td><td><code>bool</code></td><td>true</td><td>When false the input is hidden and tags cannot be changed</td></tr>
				<tr><td><code>IsReadOnly</code></td><td><code>bool</code></td><td>false</td><td>Tags are displayed but cannot be added or removed</td></tr>
				<tr><td><code>Placeholder</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>Add tag...</td><td>Placeholder text shown when no tags are present</td></tr>
				<tr><td><code>TagTemplate</code></td><td><code>RenderFragment&lt;string&gt;?</code></td><td>null</td><td>Custom chip content; receives the tag text as context</td></tr>
				<tr><td><code>CssClass</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>""</td><td>Additional CSS classes on the root element</td></tr>
			</tbody>
		</table>
	</section>

	<section id="events">
		<h2 class="doc-section">Events</h2>
		<table class="table table-sm doc-props-table">
			<thead>
				<tr><th>Event</th><th>Argument</th><th>Description</th></tr>
			</thead>
			<tbody>
				<tr><td><code>ValuesChanged</code></td><td><code>List&lt;string&gt;</code></td><td>Fired whenever the tags change; a new list instance is supplied</td></tr>
				<tr><td><code>TagAdded</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>Fired when a tag is added</td></tr>
				<tr><td><code>TagRemoved</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>Fired when a tag is removed</td></tr>
				<tr><td><code>TagRejected</code></td><td><code>TagRejectedEventArgs</code></td><td>Fired when an attempted tag is rejected; includes the tag and a <code>TagRejectionReason</code> (Duplicate, TooLong, MaxTagsReached, NotInSuggestions)</td></tr>
			</tbody>
		</table>
	</section>

	<section id="methods">
		<h2 class="doc-section">Public Methods</h2>
		<table class="table table-sm doc-props-table">
			<thead>
				<tr><th>Method</th><th>Returns</th><th>Description</th></tr>
			</thead>
			<tbody>
				<tr><td><code>FocusAsync()</code></td><td><code>Task</code></td><td>Moves focus to the tag input element</td></tr>
			</tbody>
		</table>
	</section>

	<section id="keyboard">
		<h2 class="doc-section">Keyboard Support</h2>
		<table class="table table-sm doc-props-table">
			<thead>
				<tr><th>Key</th><th>Action</th></tr>
			</thead>
			<tbody>
				<tr><td><kbd>Enter</kbd></td><td>Add the highlighted suggestion, or commit the typed text</td></tr>
				<tr><td><kbd>,</kbd></td><td>Commit the typed text (pasted comma-separated lists are split)</td></tr>
				<tr><td><kbd>Backspace</kbd></td><td>Remove the last tag when the input is empty</td></tr>
				<tr><td><kbd>ArrowDown</kbd> / <kbd>ArrowUp</kbd></td><td>Open the suggestions dropdown and move the highlight</td></tr>
				<tr><td><kbd>Escape</kbd></td><td>Close the suggestions dropdown</td></tr>
			</tbody>
		</table>
	</section>

	<section id="css-variables">
		<h2 class="doc-section">CSS Variables</h2>
		<p>
